  "notes": "Clarion Republican county committee members were last on the ballot in the April 23, 2024 primary as 'Republican County Committee <precinct>', vote for 2 per precinct; the May 19, 2026 primary report has Democratic county committee contests but no Republican ones. A seat is 'filled' when a printed ballot candidate received votes, 'empty' when no candidate ran and zero write-in votes were cast, and 'unknown' when write-in votes were cast; this includes seats where the report names a write-in recipient, because it does not show whether that person qualified or accepted. The 2024 report lists 40 precincts, matching the map's county file. Appointments or vacancies since 2024 are not reflected."
